  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "note-page-1",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -150,
      "w": 620,
      "page": "page-1",
      "text": "Studio is the hub \u2014 every board here answers a question that needs more than one system at once.\n\nFigures are illustrative. Dashes are deliberate: they mark what the console would genuinely not know."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-page-2",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -150,
      "w": 620,
      "page": "page-2",
      "text": "Coach portal \u2014 does not exist yet. These are proposals.\n\nBuilt on tables that already exist: sessions, coach_requests, program_templates, session_approvals."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-page-3",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -150,
      "w": 620,
      "page": "page-3",
      "text": "Member portal \u2014 does not exist yet. These are proposals.\n\nThe web can hold what a phone screen cannot: eighteen weeks of squat top sets on one line, a full scan history, a nutrition target with its reason beside it."
    }
